FUNCTION /PSYNG/SW_INVISIBLE.
*"----------------------------------------------------------------------
*"*"Local interface:
*"----------------------------------------------------------------------
*BOC:UMITTAL CVA scan fix 27/02/2026
CONSTANTS: lc_fname TYPE rs38l_fnam
        VALUE '/PSYNG/SW_INVISIBLE'.
